test "cve rank567 cvrf-csaf-converter: objectify.makeparser resolve_entities false suppresses XXE"
  lang python
  reject VYQL-DESER-004
  code
  ```
  from lxml import objectify

  def _open_and_validate_file(file_path):
      parser = objectify.makeparser(resolve_entities=False)
      xml_objectified = objectify.parse(file_path, parser)
      return xml_objectified.getroot()
  ```
